  <h3>Why Choose Embroidery for Your Lifestyle Collection?</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Superior Durability:</strong> Unlike prints that may crack or fade, embroidery threads are woven directly into the fabric, lasting for the entire lifespan of the garment.</li>
    <li><strong>Premium 3D Texture:</strong> Embroidery adds a tactile, elevated feel that customers associate with high-end luxury brands.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Optimized for Hoodies & Sweatpants</h3>
  <p>Embroidery is particularly effective on heavier fabrics. For our <strong>300-400GSM cotton-blend fleece</strong> hoodies and joggers, embroidery provides the necessary weight and structure to prevent the fabric from puckering.</p>
  
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Intricate Details:</strong> Our multi-head machines handle complex designs with up to 12 thread colors.</li>
    <li><strong>Versatile Positioning:</strong> Left chest, sleeve cuffs, or the hip area of sweatpants are popular choices.</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="mt-12 p-8 bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-2xl">
    <h3 class="text-[#C9A84C] mt-0">Ready to start your premium collection?</h3>
    <p>Send us your logo in AI or PDF format, and our technical team will provide a digital mockup and thread count analysis within 24 hours.</p>
